      "message": "test(post): pin the row-lower and stock-material cases of the hole feed rating\n\nTwo MCP pins for the review of PR #2729: a running feed raised above the\ndocument material's row keeps the row as the rating (post refusal and the\nnew-op seed), and a stock material other than the document's is rated by\nits own row. A unit pin covers a row feed that is zero or not finite.\n\nRefs #2724\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
